Happy New Year!

We hope everyone had a great end of the year and we hope that 2022 will be much better than the last one!

And to start the year off right, we are releasing our sixth update of Opus Castle, with some improvements and even adding new features that have been implemented to improve the experience for all players.

Check it out:

[hr][/hr]
Highlights

 Added a "Ring" item as a collectible in inventory;
 It is now possible to accumulate the same type of item in the inventory;
 Control support implemented in the chess minigame;


Improvements/Corrections

 Achievements bug fix;
 Fixed some camera and gameplay bugs;
 Inventory item icons have been fixed;
 Fixed bathroom door collision in "Chapter 2";
 Synchronization of voice acting for a character at the end of "Chapter 2";
 Fixed some visual bugs;

[hr][/hr]

Thank you all and have a great week!

