Hi guys!

We're in our fifth update and this time we've had some tweaks to the gameplay experience, especially for first-timers. Check it out all the changes:

Patch 1.0.5

Highlights

 A new cutscene has been added when starting a new game;
 Added chapters menu;
 "New Game" and "Continue" buttons from the main menu are one now;



If you have any problems with the game or find any bugs, let us know on the Steam forum!


Thanks everyone and have a great week!



